{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss battles await on the Game Boy Color!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tad-Bubble is a boss rush shoot \u2018em up for the Game Boy Color! Fight off waves of dangerous boss bugs, boss fish, and boss more in this brand-new retro experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/extras/f4217819ee93d894e91c606aceabf87d.poster.avif?t=1764592916\" width=614 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/extras/f4217819ee93d894e91c606aceabf87d.webm?t=1764592916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a fresh take on that retro feel.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tad-Bubble is a love letter to old-school handheld gaming, designed for quick pick-up-and-play sessions. Use the power of your Miracle Bubble to face off against <strong>50+ unique bosses</strong> and try to make it all the way to the end, where your final challenge awaits\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/extras/01abbc6e5e33b027696f1d67109defce.poster.avif?t=1764592916\" width=614 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/extras/01abbc6e5e33b027696f1d67109defce.webm?t=1764592916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t underestimate these critters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey to the end will be tough, but every setback comes with valuable experience! The more bosses you face, the more you\u2019ll find your skills improving. You\u2019ll get to heal up between fights, but be careful; your supply of healing items is limited!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/extras/cf36f0fbbd5b8a9e3d262f24a43f4de4.poster.avif?t=1764592916\" width=614 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/extras/cf36f0fbbd5b8a9e3d262f24a43f4de4.webm?t=1764592916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 50 unique bosses</strong>, each with their own patterns and quirks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect pages</strong> for your Bestiary as you face new bosses! Try to get them all!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Records!</strong> How quickly can you get to the end? Try to beat your own score!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Infinite mode!</strong> Test your mettle against never-ending waves of bosses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in music player to listen to an all-original chiptune soundtrack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true retro experience, Tad-Bubble runs on real Game Boy Color hardware!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret bosses\u2026?!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016690?t=1764592916","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/8e80bba38c747996c857cc163128fbe11728fa34/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764592916","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/5883169bd6e3191936f8367ae1cb65dd31d33beb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764592916","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/5883169bd6e3191936f8367ae1cb65dd31d33beb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764592916","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss battles await on the Game Boy Color!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tad-Bubble is a boss rush shoot \u2018em up for the Game Boy Color! Fight off waves of dangerous boss bugs, boss fish, and boss more in this brand-new retro experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/extras/f4217819ee93d894e91c606aceabf87d.poster.avif?t=1764592916\" width=614 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/extras/f4217819ee93d894e91c606aceabf87d.webm?t=1764592916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a fresh take on that retro feel.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tad-Bubble is a love letter to old-school handheld gaming, designed for quick pick-up-and-play sessions. Use the power of your Miracle Bubble to face off against <strong>50+ unique bosses</strong> and try to make it all the way to the end, where your final challenge awaits\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/extras/01abbc6e5e33b027696f1d67109defce.poster.avif?t=1764592916\" width=614 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/extras/01abbc6e5e33b027696f1d67109defce.webm?t=1764592916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t underestimate these critters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey to the end will be tough, but every setback comes with valuable experience! The more bosses you face, the more you\u2019ll find your skills improving. You\u2019ll get to heal up between fights, but be careful; your supply of healing items is limited!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/extras/cf36f0fbbd5b8a9e3d262f24a43f4de4.poster.avif?t=1764592916\" width=614 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/extras/cf36f0fbbd5b8a9e3d262f24a43f4de4.webm?t=1764592916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 50 unique bosses</strong>, each with their own patterns and quirks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect pages</strong> for your Bestiary as you face new bosses! Try to get them all!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Records!</strong> How quickly can you get to the end? Try to beat your own score!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Infinite mode!</strong> Test your mettle against never-ending waves of bosses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in music player to listen to an all-original chiptune soundtrack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true retro experience, Tad-Bubble runs on real Game Boy Color hardware!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret bosses\u2026?!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Gapucho"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header